---
---
<section id="logistica" data-screen-label="Transporte" style="max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;padding:clamp(72px,10vw,120px) 24px clamp(32px,4vw,48px);scroll-margin-top:96px">
  <div class="reveal" style="display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:16px;margin-bottom:14px">
    <span class="rule-grow" style="width:34px;height:1px;background:#BD9750;display:block"></span>
    <p style="margin:0;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:2.8px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8A7238">Línea principal · Ágora Logística</p>
  </div>
  <div class="reveal" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(300px,1fr));gap:clamp(24px,4vw,64px);align-items:end;margin-bottom:clamp(36px,5vw,56px)">
    <h2 style="margin:0;font-family:Montserrat,sans-serif;font-weight:300;font-size:clamp(28px,3.6vw,50px);line-height:1.14;letter-spacing:-1.1px;color:#0C203E;max-width:20ch">Transporte de carga por carretera, sin sorpresas en el camino</h2>
    <p style="margin:0;font-size:16px;font-weight:300;line-height:1.8;color:#4A5262;max-width:44ch">Vehículo asignado según su mercancía, conductor verificado, póliza vigente y reporte de novedades antes de que usted tenga que preguntar.</p>
  </div>

  <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(270px,1fr));gap:clamp(16px,2vw,22px)">
    <article class="reveal lift" style="background:#FFFDF8;border:1px solid rgba(12,32,62,0.10);border-top:3px solid #BD9750;padding:clamp(26px,3vw,36px);display:flex;flex-direction:column">
      <svg width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 40 40" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" style="margin-bottom:22px">
        <path d="M2 10h20v16H2z" stroke="#0C203E" stroke-width="1.4" />
        <path d="M22 15h7l5 6v5h-12z" stroke="#0C203E" stroke-width="1.4" />
        <circle cx="10" cy="29" r="3" stroke="#BD9750" stroke-width="1.6" />
        <circle cx="28" cy="29" r="3" stroke="#BD9750" stroke-width="1.6" />
        <path d="M13 29h12" stroke="#0C203E" stroke-width="1.4" />
      </svg>
      <h3 style="margin:0;font-family:Montserrat,sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:19px;line-height:1.3;color:#0C203E">Carga general y masiva</h3>
      <p style="margin:12px 0 0;font-size:14.5px;font-weight:300;line-height:1.7;color:#4A5262">Tractocamiones, sencillos y turbos según el volumen. Cargue paletizado o a granel, con control de peso en origen.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="reveal lift" style="background:#FFFDF8;border:1px solid rgba(12,32,62,0.10);border-top:3px solid #BD9750;padding:clamp(26px,3vw,36px);display:flex;flex-direction:column">
      <svg width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 40 40" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" style="margin-bottom:22px">
        <path d="M20 5v30M20 5l-6 6M20 5l6 6M20 35l-6-6M20 35l6-6" stroke="#0C203E" stroke-width="1.4" />
        <path d="M7 12.5l26 15M7 27.5l26-15" stroke="#BD9750" stroke-width="1.4" />
      </svg>
      <h3 style="margin:0;font-family:Montserrat,sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:19px;line-height:1.3;color:#0C203E">Cadena de frío</h3>
      <p style="margin:12px 0 0;font-size:14.5px;font-weight:300;line-height:1.7;color:#4A5262">Furgones refrigerados con registro de temperatura documentado por tramo. Alimentos, farmacéuticos y flores.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="reveal lift" style="background:#FFFDF8;border:1px solid rgba(12,32,62,0.10);border-top:3px solid #BD9750;padding:clamp(26px,3vw,36px);display:flex;flex-direction:column">
      <svg width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 40 40" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" style="margin-bottom:22px">
        <path d="M5 27V13h30v14z" stroke="#0C203E" stroke-width="1.4" />
        <path d="M5 20h30" stroke="#BD9750" stroke-width="1.4" />
        <path d="M2 8h6M32 8h6M2 32h6M32 32h6" stroke="#BD9750" stroke-width="1.6" />
      </svg>
      <h3 style="margin:0;font-family:Montserrat,sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:19px;line-height:1.3;color:#0C203E">Extradimensionada</h3>
      <p style="margin:12px 0 0;font-size:14.5px;font-weight:300;line-height:1.7;color:#4A5262">Camabajas y planchones con permisos de tránsito, escolta y estudio de ruta previo al despacho.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="reveal lift" style="background:#FFFDF8;border:1px solid rgba(12,32,62,0.10);border-top:3px solid #BD9750;padding:clamp(26px,3vw,36px);display:flex;flex-direction:column">
      <svg width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 40 40" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" style="margin-bottom:22px">
        <path d="M20 4c5.5 0 10 4.3 10 9.7 0 7-10 22.3-10 22.3S10 20.7 10 13.7C10 8.3 14.5 4 20 4z" stroke="#0C203E" stroke-width="1.4" />
        <circle cx="20" cy="14" r="3.6" stroke="#BD9750" stroke-width="1.6" />
      </svg>
      <h3 style="margin:0;font-family:Montserrat,sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:19px;line-height:1.3;color:#0C203E">Última milla urbana</h3>
      <p style="margin:12px 0 0;font-size:14.5px;font-weight:300;line-height:1.7;color:#4A5262">Distribución en Bogotá y ciudades principales con ventanas horarias y confirmación de entrega firmada.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="reveal lift" style="background:#FFFDF8;border:1px solid rgba(12,32,62,0.10);border-top:3px solid #BD9750;padding:clamp(26px,3vw,36px);display:flex;flex-direction:column">
      <svg width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 40 40" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" style="margin-bottom:22px">
        <circle cx="20" cy="20" r="15" stroke="#0C203E" stroke-width="1.4" />
        <path d="M20 5c4 4.4 6 9.4 6 15s-2 10.6-6 15c-4-4.4-6-9.4-6-15s2-10.6 6-15z" stroke="#0C203E" stroke-width="1.2" />
        <path d="M5 20h30" stroke="#0C203E" stroke-width="1.2" />
        <path d="M20 13l4 12-4-2.6-4 2.6z" fill="#BD9750" />
      </svg>
      <h3 style="margin:0;font-family:Montserrat,sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:19px;line-height:1.3;color:#0C203E">Trazabilidad en línea</h3>
      <p style="margin:12px 0 0;font-size:14.5px;font-weight:300;line-height:1.7;color:#4A5262">GPS 24/7, alertas de desvío y un informe mensual de cumplimiento con los indicadores que firmamos.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="reveal lift" style="background:#0C203E;border:1px solid #0C203E;border-top:3px solid #BD9750;padding:clamp(26px,3vw,36px);display:flex;flex-direction:column">
      <h3 style="margin:0;font-family:Montserrat,sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:19px;line-height:1.3;color:#F7F5EF">¿Tiene una ruta en firme?</h3>
      <p style="margin:12px 0 24px;font-size:14.5px;font-weight:300;line-height:1.7;color:#B7BDC8">Envíenos origen, destino y tipo de carga. Devolvemos franja tarifaria y disponibilidad de vehículo en cuatro horas hábiles.</p>
      <div class="road" style="margin:auto 0 22px"></div>
      <a href="#contacto" data-pick-intent="logistica" class="btn-fill-gold" style="align-self:flex-start;border:1px solid #BD9750;color:#BD9750;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:1.8px;text-transform:uppercase;padding:16px 28px;min-height:44px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center">Cotizar carga</a>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>
